        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "270b0d6d-98e5-361f-aa9b-94f4702d1eb3",
                "word": "rebuffade",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "a9358fb5-c3c4-4caf-8a39-20e28e0ce9de",
                        "entry_id": "270b0d6d-98e5-361f-aa9b-94f4702d1eb3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "rebuffades"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8568dc90-82cc-3baf-baaf-cfb00b845971",
                        "entry_id": "270b0d6d-98e5-361f-aa9b-94f4702d1eb3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Attitude de refus brutal d’une demande ou d’une attente."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "db0ee547-3c2c-40b1-8603-694940b03597",
                                "sense_id": "8568dc90-82cc-3baf-baaf-cfb00b845971",
                                "text": "Et jamais, au plus fort des rebuffades et des duretés, jamais un geste de colère, jamais un mot de reproche !…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e20dd91-6c62-41f0-8107-037ac58c9ecc",
                                "sense_id": "8568dc90-82cc-3baf-baaf-cfb00b845971",
                                "text": "Il m’a dit les larmes aux yeux que son assuidité au presbytère lui valait beaucoup de rebuffades, de railleries."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8694b382-852e-4a6c-8c28-b072683f506e",
                                "sense_id": "8568dc90-82cc-3baf-baaf-cfb00b845971",
                                "text": "J’aime à trouver, quand je rentre, quelqu’un qui me connaît, qui a subi mes rebuffades et ne me pose pas de questions."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "59983dcd-f540-4ea9-a6b9-af1f7955cb4c",
                                "sense_id": "8568dc90-82cc-3baf-baaf-cfb00b845971",
                                "text": "Jamais Jan n’aurait cru qu’un Suisse pouvait absorber tant d’alcool sans en paraître incommodé. Werner, d’abord grognon, l’avait reçu avec une mauvais grâce non dissimulée ; puis, comme Jan était de ceux qui acceptent en souriant les pires rebuffades, il finit par faire bon visage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e13e71a-f163-48cb-b0af-8cbb4ce09a46",
                                "sense_id": "8568dc90-82cc-3baf-baaf-cfb00b845971",
                                "text": "La décision de Barack Obama de renoncer à un sommet prévu entre l’Union européenne et les États-Unis, au printemps, constitue une rebuffade de plus pour les Européens."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ffd089da-f485-4ce1-90d9-78862b4fbc46",
                                "sense_id": "8568dc90-82cc-3baf-baaf-cfb00b845971",
                                "text": "Je subis notamment quelques rebuffades de retraités anglais (ce qui n’était pas très grave, on ne peut jamais être bien accueilli par l’Anglais, l’Anglais est presque aussi raciste que le Japonais dont il constitue en quelque sorte une version allégée)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba6c36a0-8023-4a7b-9380-7ded3289c67e",
                                "sense_id": "8568dc90-82cc-3baf-baaf-cfb00b845971",
                                "text": "Je lui ai tendu une perche en lui demandant directement, et j'ai essuyé une rebuffade, puis une pirouette."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9527e2c5-5d3c-4296-a354-365f76c7697c",
                        "source_entry_id": "270b0d6d-98e5-361f-aa9b-94f4702d1eb3",
                        "source_sense_id": "8568dc90-82cc-3baf-baaf-cfb00b845971",
                        "target_lang_word": "Abfuhr",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Abfuhr",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d85b16f4-9a67-3f29-a36d-5d9b247bdfc7",
                                        "entry_id": "baeec9b9-da9b-39a4-a644-898edf9b6b98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "das Wegfahren, Abtransportieren von etwas"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4db69f8b-8c0c-49dd-ba19-f3f9efe1fb34",
                                                "sense_id": "d85b16f4-9a67-3f29-a36d-5d9b247bdfc7",
                                                "text": "Für die Abfuhr des Sperrmülls müssen wir 40 Euro bezahlen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "410bd3dd-9aab-3302-a10c-4037f9a2f30b",
                                        "entry_id": "baeec9b9-da9b-39a4-a644-898edf9b6b98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "vorzeitiger Abbruch einer Mensur"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Verbindungswesen"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd213639-b3a9-4d06-8942-761c3789cd3a",
                                                "sense_id": "410bd3dd-9aab-3302-a10c-4037f9a2f30b",
                                                "text": "Verhält sich ein Paukant nicht nach den vorgeschriebenen Regeln, wird eine Abfuhr erklärt."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4dd4f0c2-2750-3e54-a943-9e07a4ee54a3",
                                        "entry_id": "baeec9b9-da9b-39a4-a644-898edf9b6b98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine Zurückweisung, Niederlage"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6f7d144-c3dd-4b68-9904-e8b174b351f3",
                                                "sense_id": "4dd4f0c2-2750-3e54-a943-9e07a4ee54a3",
                                                "text": "Mit einem riesigen Blumenstrauß erschien er bei seiner Angebeteten, aber er erhielt nur eine Abfuhr."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1adc0d39-2697-4dd4-9685-726dfcb25ebb",
                                                "sense_id": "4dd4f0c2-2750-3e54-a943-9e07a4ee54a3",
                                                "text": "„Als Mitsotakis kürzlich mit der Kanzlerin in Berlin redete, erhielt also auch er eine Abfuhr.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "34fe489b-7c23-4552-80e4-7785e68d9bda",
                        "source_entry_id": "270b0d6d-98e5-361f-aa9b-94f4702d1eb3",
                        "source_sense_id": "8568dc90-82cc-3baf-baaf-cfb00b845971",
                        "target_lang_word": "rebuff",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rebuff",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36d409bf-8b58-3422-9efd-d0ff356d04ac",
                                        "entry_id": "185c8097-bce7-3d32-9182-f2a68bf9a0f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sudden resistance or refusal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f0dbbf4-a3e6-4968-a36b-6e305b00eb26",
                                                "sense_id": "36d409bf-8b58-3422-9efd-d0ff356d04ac",
                                                "text": "He was surprised by her quick rebuff to his proposal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec2315df-6bc8-4b0e-b65e-8055da8ba542",
                                                "sense_id": "36d409bf-8b58-3422-9efd-d0ff356d04ac",
                                                "text": "And it is symptomatic of the many paradoxes of Lederer's life that of all the people in the room, Brotherhood is the one whom he would most wish to serve, if ever he had the opportunity, even though — or perhaps because — his occasional efforts to ingratiate himself with his adopted hero have met with iron rebuff."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3334da1d-efcd-44ed-9999-b6cf187008f1",
                                                "sense_id": "36d409bf-8b58-3422-9efd-d0ff356d04ac",
                                                "text": "His administration’s blunt rebuff of a plea by his ally and Michigan’s Democratic Gov. Gretchen Whitmer for an increased supply of vaccines to combat a Covid-19 spike represents the kind of tough decision the President and his team will increasingly face on the exit road from the crisis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0eba20d7-ea07-4904-b351-f703c04b4ed2",
                                                "sense_id": "36d409bf-8b58-3422-9efd-d0ff356d04ac",
                                                "text": "U.S. President Joe Biden said on Thursday that he would support a new election in Venezuela, after Brazilian President Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva also floated the idea, despite rebuffs from Venezuela's ruling party and its opposition which both claim victory in the July 28 contest."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33beb403-0e47-3ebc-9fa5-bf0192077cea",
                                        "entry_id": "185c8097-bce7-3d32-9182-f2a68bf9a0f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Repercussion, or beating back."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "131a9c5b-3684-4bd2-a100-3e3e28019da1",
                                                "sense_id": "33beb403-0e47-3ebc-9fa5-bf0192077cea",
                                                "text": "the strong rebuff of some tumultuous cloud"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "rebuff",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f29fca7-aff0-3f8c-816e-795b86b488fc",
                                        "entry_id": "3b396783-c378-3cab-ac1e-f639b8d49eae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To refuse; to offer sudden or harsh resistance; to turn down or shut out."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fef0526e-8a59-49f9-b618-37f6a9bbd5e5",
                                                "sense_id": "0f29fca7-aff0-3f8c-816e-795b86b488fc",
                                                "text": "The plaque (2014) doesn't tell you that Leonard [Woolf] had initially been rebuffed. His intended proposal was refused by Virginia [Woolf to be], who then had a change of heart."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e4eb725-3732-4ff4-aaef-d307cc36a135",
                                                "sense_id": "0f29fca7-aff0-3f8c-816e-795b86b488fc",
                                                "text": "Lawyers for CBS News are rebuffing a legal threat from Donald Trump over the network’s “60 Minutes” interview with Kamala Harris, telling the former president his demands are based on a “faulty premise.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "682afe6b-15a2-441c-82a6-5ba1b1acd87a",
                                                "sense_id": "0f29fca7-aff0-3f8c-816e-795b86b488fc",
                                                "text": "“If you have rule of the bureaucrat — if the bureaucracy is in charge, then what meaning does democracy actually have?” Musk said during his 30-minute appearance with Trump, where he rebuffed critics who said he’s the one undermining democratic institutions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
